@model NewVixSmart.Web.Models.Purchases.PurchaseReturn
@inject NewVixSmart.Web.Services.IPermissionService Perm
@{ ViewData["Title"] = $"تفاصيل مرتجع {Model.ReturnNumber}"; }

<div class="page-header d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
    <h2><i class="bi bi-eye text-primary"></i> مرتجع شراء: @Model.ReturnNumber</h2>
    <div>
        @if (Model.Status == NewVixSmart.Web.Models.Accounting.ReturnStatus.Draft && await Perm.HasAsync("PurchaseReturns.Post"))
        {
            <form asp-action="Post" asp-route-id="@Model.Id" method="post" class="d-inline" data-confirm="هل تريد ترحيل هذا المرتجع؟" data-confirm-ok="ترحيل">
                @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-success"><i class="bi bi-check-circle"></i> ترحيل المرتجع</button>
            </form>
        }
        <a asp-action="Print" asp-route-id="@Model.Id" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-outline-primary"><i class="bi bi-printer"></i> طباعة</a>
        <a asp-action="Pdf" asp-route-id="@Model.Id" class="btn btn-outline-primary"><i class="bi bi-filetype-pdf"></i> تحميل PDF</a>
        <a asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-outline-secondary"><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i> رجوع</a>
    </div>
</div>

@if (TempData["Success"] != null)
{
    <div class="alert alert-success alert-dismissible fade show" role="alert">@TempData["Success"]<button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="إغلاق"></button></div>
}
@if (TempData["Error"] != null)
{
    <div class="alert alert-danger alert-dismissible fade show" role="alert">@TempData["Error"]<button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="إغلاق"></button></div>
}

<div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="card-body">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-2"><strong>الحالة:</strong>
                @if (Model.Status == NewVixSmart.Web.Models.Accounting.ReturnStatus.Posted)
                {
                    <span class="badge bg-success">مرحّل</span>
                    <small class="text-muted d-block">@Model.PostedBy — @Model.PostedAt?.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy HH:mm")</small>
                }
                else
                {
                    <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark">مسودة</span>
                }
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3"><strong>المورد:</strong> @(Model.Supplier?.Name ?? "—")</div>
            <div class="col-md-2"><strong>التاريخ:</strong> @Model.ReturnDate.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy")</div>
            <div class="col-md-3"><strong>الفاتورة الأصلية:</strong> @(Model.PurchaseInvoice?.InvoiceNumber ?? "—")</div>
            <div class="col-md-2"><strong>أنشأها:</strong> @(Model.CreatedBy ?? "—")</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="table-container mb-4">
    <table class="table mb-0">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">الصنف</th><th scope="col">العدد</th><th scope="col">الكمية</th><th scope="col">سعر الوحدة</th><th scope="col">الإجمالي</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
            @foreach (var item in Model.Items)
            {
                <tr>
                    <td>@item.Item.Name</td>
                    <td>@item.Count</td>
                    <td>@item.Quantity</td>
                    <td>@item.UnitPrice.ToString("N2")</td>
                    <td class="fw-bold">@item.Total.ToString("N2")</td>
                </tr>
            }
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>

<div class="row g-3">
    <div class="col-md-4"><div class="card text-center"><div class="card-body"><div class="text-muted small">السبب</div><h6>@(Model.Reason ?? "—")</h6></div></div></div>
    <div class="col-md-8"><div class="card text-center bg-danger text-white"><div class="card-body"><div class="small">إجمالي المرتجع</div><h4>@Model.TotalAmount.ToString("N2") ج.م</h4></div></div></div>
</div>
